 4.76 rad/sec</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> 70 and 4.76 rad/sec</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> 35 and 9.53 rad/sec</div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>(a)</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/70848c19f30c6be27ca644bf395ae635cf2c5d0a.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n<div> </div>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":14,"type":"NAT","correct":"","right":2,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>The system shown in figure (a) when subjected to a unit-step input gives the output response shown in figure (b). The value of <em>k</em> is, (Rounded upto 2 decimal places)</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/886415f34dba4ee56b7f08fda82f85d01390d594.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"1.42","high":"1.42"},"solution":"<p>1.42 (1.38 - 1.46)</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/9cc1a66dcbdab86749751b735786282271be1dc1.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/93082cec4c72d2c928583ea60434aaaef3a7bdb9.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":15,"type":"NAT","correct":"","right":2,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>A feedback system has an open-loop transfer function,</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/b3831342d94662f4b17b7a3908c6aad4b249e68b.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n<div>The maximum value of k for which the closed-loop system is stable is, (Rounded upto one decimal place)</div></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"7.5","high":"7.5"},"solution":"<p>7.5 (7.2 - 7.7)</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/7acf413c2be61635be1b9d9b14fcfde8f682e186.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":16,"type":"NAT","correct":"","right":2,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>A control system is designed to keep the antenna of a tracking radar pointed at a flying target.<br />\nThe system must be able to follow a target travelling in a straight line with a speed of 300 m/s with maximum permissible error 0.02 degree. The shortest distance from the antenna to the target is 350 m. The value of error constant <img src=\"/media/82cda88040f69b14911012e08ef6b29ef3489857.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> in order to satisfy the requirements is _________.<br />\n(Rounded upto 2 decimal places)</p></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"2028.27","high":"2028.27"},"solution":"<p>2028.27 (2027.25 - 2029.32)</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/da11fc692e79fc9d079bda77bb314fcc4b330656.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":17,"type":"MSQ","correct":"A,B,C,D","right":2,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>The closed loop transfer function of unity feedback system is given as <img src=\"/media/c716173b3a704c6791d5856dd5e2e1ed368703f3.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>Consider the given below statements and choose the correct statement(s) about root locus of the system.</p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> Centroid is not the part of root locus.</div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> The centroid of the root locus is at (–5, 0).</div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> <em>s</em> = –2 is the break away point on root locus.</div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> For <em>k</em> = 5, roots lies on <em>j</em>ω-axis.</div>","isCorrect":true}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>(a, b, c, d)</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/6cdc5fd4e69f45ea574408811b5223f5fc21303d.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/2947a0fdfa0b35cd3db6ef512fa71b63d2179efe.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>","subject":"Technical"}],"questionCount":17,"parsedAt":"2026-11-10T19:39:16.205Z"}